[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5348.95, "timestamp": "01:29:08", "text": "我们不会，我们不会伤害任何人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5352.94, "timestamp": "01:29:12", "text": "边界。我们做这些事只是为了好玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5355.11, "timestamp": "01:29:15", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5357.669, "timestamp": "01:29:17", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5359.91, "timestamp": "01:29:19", "text": "我在画你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5365.27, "timestamp": "01:29:25", "text": "谢谢。你在画轮子吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5385.35, "timestamp": "01:29:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5387.11, "timestamp": "01:29:47", "text": "除非我得到许可，否则这会毁了我们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5388.229, "timestamp": "01:29:48", "text": "不知怎么的。但是不行，那样会毁了一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5390.79, "timestamp": "01:29:50", "text": "令两人都感到惊讶。确切地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5393.43, "timestamp": "01:29:53", "text": "我们只是保持现状，如果……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5395.27, "timestamp": "01:29:55", "text": "你在创作讽刺作品，所以一定要确保这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5398.55, "timestamp": "01:29:58", "text": "评级是PG-13，因为我觉得他们还没有……"}]